ass=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow Bullet Speeds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Reload</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…and many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for an unorthodox challenge? Complete Contracts: remixed missions with different objectives and Paradox mode pre-sets for additional Paradox unlocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arena:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574480/extras/f5ffca83029eef37e6ac5244e2fef5cb.poster.avif?t=1786538539\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574480/extras/f5ffca83029eef37e6ac5244e2fef5cb.webm?t=1786538539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574480/extras/f5ffca83029eef37e6ac5244e2fef5cb.mp4?t=1786538539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against friends in local split-screen multiplayer combat, or take the gunfight online with up to 8 players and 8 additional bots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy full lobby customization including teams, weapon set, rule sets and paradox modifiers, with up to 10 saved pre-sets to your liking. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deathmatch: Classic deathmatch, score the more frags to win!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Briefcase: Capture the briefcase and hold it for long enough to score a point. But don't get too comfortable, after each point won, the briefcase position is reset to a random point on the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zone: You have to capture the zone on the map to score points. Don't let any enemy contest it as it will stall the countdown!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges: special matches against pre-set bots where players must reach a precise score under a certain amount of time. The faster you win, the better the prizes. Unlock maps, characters, music tracks, and more!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A retro spy FPS inspired by the N64 era. Go guns-blazing in action-packed shootouts, steal secret plans, and accomplish objectives while foiling evildoers’ schemes as a secret agent in a solo or co-op campaign. Fight friends in both local split-screen multiplayer and online with up to 8 opponents.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, French", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574480/f281ff155778294664365fbcedc884319ed172fd/header.jpg?t=1786538539", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574480/3310c2b11a17d8188ccb4e26e0e57ba89131b5d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786538539", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574480/3310c2b11a17d8188ccb4e26e0e57ba89131b5d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786538539", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7500 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_